  "EditorMetadata": {
    "Description": "R4 acceptance A3\u002BA4 - a resolver graph that REACHES THE WORLD. Before R4 a Construction graph on a Library asset compiled to a static method whose only parameters were the graph\u0027s inputs (EmissionContext.HasSelfInScope was false for Library), so it could only do arithmetic on the DTO it was handed and the motivating case was not expressible. Here the FunctionCall declares TrailingContext=View, so the compiler appends the in-scope world, and NetworkEntityMapOps.ResolveTarget reads the NetworkEntityMap WORLD SINGLETON through it and returns the Entity - which SetMembers copies into PlatoonHillAttackParams.TargetAreaEntity, leaving every other member preserved. That DTO is the one R-132\u0027s silent failure was about, which is why it is the one used here.",
    "Category": "Demo",
    "Recipe": null
  }
}